WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.440
Identify good leadership qualities

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.442
Leader: a person who helps others work toward a shared goal. Integrity: doing what is

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.539
right even when nobody is watching.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:18.600
Listening: paying attention to other people’s views. Service: using your abilities to

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.756
help others. Accountability: explaining decisions and accepting responsibility.

00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:27.051
Role-play a class meeting where everyone has a chance to speak.
